{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/mag-330-mag-group-city-of-arabia","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":584,"crm_id":"110","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Mag 330","slug":"mag-330-mag-group-city-of-arabia","display_address":"City Of Arabia","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"MAG Group","price":808000,"display_price":"808K","lattitude":25.0899734,"longitude":55.3253592,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Mag 330 is a premium project by developer Mag Group in the prestigious City Of Arabia neighborhood. The building is 23 floors high and has a modern design, with panoramic windows offering enchanting views of the city. Each residence has balconies that harmonize with the architectural style of the building.</p><p>On the territory of the complex there are green landscaped parks and gardens with recreational facilities and a barbecue area, a swimming pool with a common area, a sports ground with jogging tracks and a hall for Pilates and yoga.</p><p>In the neighboring neighborhoods there are schools, kindergartens, hospitals and other social organizations. Dubai Autodrome, Global Village and IMG Worlds of Adventure can be reached in 10 minutes and Dubai Outlet Mall can be reached in 15 minutes.</p><p>MAG 330 is designed for maximum comfort. The project is a stylish blend of aesthetics and practicality, with spacious apartments offering upscale living standards complemented by the finest finishes.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/110/images/2024/02/12/LxXJyYv6DiVJ2gAWCfd2ajq1l9kU9xMAyRWyxquu.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/12/LxXJyYv6DiVJ2gAWCfd2ajq1l9kU9xMAyRWyxquu.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https:/